  "body": "Following https://github.com/w3c/webidl2.js/pull/157, the HTML IDL no longer parses due to the attributes named `required`. I believe that per the spec, they should be named `_required`, as they otherwise should be interpreted as a terminal symbol `required`. (Someone should double check me there, however.)\r\n\r\ncc @saschanaz ",
